### Get news by query
GET http://localhost:5000/api/news?query=technology

###
GET http://localhost:5000/api/news?query=business

###
GET http://localhost:5000/api/news?query=health

### Missing query parameter (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/news

### Empty query parameter (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/news?query=
